{% doc %}
  Renders a product's merchant badges from its "Badges" field (custom.badges), one product-badge each.
  The one place that reads the field: usually a list (.value is an array), but a single value (one Badge
  metaobject entry or one text) is handled too, so a badge never silently disappears. Used by the product
  cards (every badge) and the product page eyebrow (the first one).

  @param {object} field - The metafield: product.metafields.custom.badges
  @param {number} [limit] - Show at most this many badges (empty = all)

  @example
  {% render 'product-badges', field: product.metafields.custom.badges %}
  {% render 'product-badges', field: product.metafields.custom.badges, limit: 1 %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- if field != blank -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign badges_limit = limit | default: 50
    if field.type contains 'list.'
      for badge in field.value limit: badges_limit
        render 'product-badge', badge: badge
      endfor
    else
      render 'product-badge', badge: field.value
    endif
  -%}
{%- endif -%}
